  (text "AMP LEFT - TAS5805M (U301), BTL, ch A = woofer, ch B = tweeter"
    (at 137.16 193.04 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ca6f23c0-67f6-409f-9b22-55e7507ffc56")
  )
  (text "I2C address 0x2C (7-bit): R301 = 4.7k ADR/FAULT strap to DVDD (+3V3). amp_right: R401 = 15k -> 0x2D. Pin 3 is also FAULTZ -> AMPL_FAULT_N (merged on mcu sheet)."
    (at 137.16 197.485 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8d6407c9-77bf-4ac4-ace7-25095aa2df0d")
  )
  (text "PVDD = 18.0 V (boost, power sheet); DVDD = +3V3. AVDD (5 V) and VR_DIG (1.5 V) are internal regulator outputs: cap only, no other load."
    (at 137.16 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "671dad19-da11-4e9c-be54-2f4fc9130ec9")
  )
  (text "Output LC per leg: 10 uH (FXL0630-100-M, Isat 5.5 A) + 1 uF 50 V X7R to GND -> BTL f0 ~ 50 kHz. Fsw = 768 kHz (FSW_SEL = 000), Hybrid modulation."
    (at 137.16 203.835 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "97adbcfe-7564-421a-819a-4a6b54a514af")
  )
  (text "Speaker terminals are BTL and float at ~PVDD/2: never tie either terminal to GND. SDOUT (pin 9) not used."
    (at 137.16 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "90a0e327-f641-4277-9193-a8142617dce4")
  )
  (text "Ch A = woofer J301, 8 ohm (ND65-8): DRC/AGL at max 15.5 V pk. Ch B = tweeter J302, 4 ohm (OT19NC00-04): limiter max 8 V pk after crossover is MANDATORY (OCP 5 A)."
    (at 137.16 207.01 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bb34b394-767e-4d63-b21e-1569bb75ca94")
  )
  (text "Layout: C304 + C302/C303 at pins 15/16, C307 + C305/C306 at pins 27/28 (100 nF within 1 mm), C301 between groups. Bootstrap C312-C315 straight BST to OUT, top layer, no vias."
    (at 137.16 210.185 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "97d1efac-5bfc-4aa1-b3aa-4f1ab971b67c")
  )
